Package: reactives
Title: Keyed Collections of 'shiny' Reactives
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nicolas", "Bennett", , "nicolas@cynkra.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Keyed collections of 'shiny' reactives whose keys can be
    added, removed and reordered, with dependencies tracked per key. The
    'shiny' package offers reactiveValues() for keyed stored values, but
    it can neither remove nor reorder keys, and it has no keyed
    collection of computed values.
